OL,3,GNEWSA'Transformative' campus and
OL,4,Astation entrance opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "transformative" #500m university
OL,7,Fcampus and new entrance to major
OL,8,Frailway station have officially opened.
OL,10,FBristol Temple Meads' #23m eastern
OL,11,Fentrance was unveiled earlier, as part
OL,12,Fof a major redevelopment of the area
OL,13,Fled by the opening of a new University
OL,14,Fof Bristol campus.
OL,16,FFor decades, much of the land on the
OL,17,Fsite was dominated by old industrial
OL,18,Fbuildings and the former Royal Mail
OL,19,Fsorting office, which Tony Dyer, leader
OL,20,Fof Bristol City Council, said were "not
OL,21,Fa good advertisement for the city".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
